data: {"id": "0a5d5b298101433c-thinking-parallel_evidence-945", "run_id": "0a5d5b298101433c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "现在所有首轮计划工具已执行完毕。让我整理关键证据：\n\n### 已采集事实\n\n1. **Kubernetes 状态 (kubectl_describe)**:\n   - Pod 状态: `Pending`\n   - 容器状态: `Waiting`, 原因: `ContainerCreating`\n   - **关键事件**: `FailedMount` — `MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found`\n   - **关键事件**: `FailedMount` — `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input], unattached volumes=[input]: timed out waiting for the condition`\n   - Volumes 定义: `input` 类型为 `ConfigMap`，名称为 `unavailable-config`，`Option", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788416390080, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

