data: {"id": "0a5d5b298101433c-final", "run_id": "0a5d5b298101433c", "seq": 1639, "ts_ms": 1788416419082, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w` | ContainerCreating | Pod spec 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' (Optional: false) 导致 Volume 'input' 挂载永久失败 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes (fact-00115bdd72de) | `Warning FailedMount 102s (x11 over 7m54s) kubelet MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` | 直接指出 Pod 因找不到指定 ConfigMap 导致 Volume 'input' 挂载永久失败 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes (fact-17873089ef55) | `Pending` | 确认 Pod 因挂载失败而处于 Pending 状态 |\n| 3 | Metric | prometheus (fact-e8c980478580) | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ContainerCreating\"} = 1` | 确认 Pod 正等待挂载，且未发生重启 (fact-73c75cd31a77: restart_count=0) |\n| 4 | K8s Config | kubernetes (fact-38b9cb181029) | `resource_request.cpu = 5m` | 排除因资源请求过高导致节点无法满足而 Pending 的可能性 |\n\nKubernetes 事件 (fact-00115bdd72de) 直接锁定了挂载失败的根本原因是 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 缺失，且由于挂载是启动的前提，该事件解释了 Metric 中观察到的 `ContainerCreating` 挂起状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod spec 引用不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config' (Optional: false) → Volume 'input' 挂载永久失败 → kubelet 阻止容器启动 (WaitReason: ContainerCreating) → Pod 处于 Pending 状态，无法提供服务\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：**Pod 配置引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'。**\n\n该 ConfigMap 被声明为 `Optional: false`，导致 Kubernetes 在 Pod 启动时无法完成 Volume 'input' 的挂载。这一失败被 kubelet 记录在 Warning 事件 (fact-00115bdd72de) 中，并直接导致 Pod 停留在 `ContainerCreating` 状态，无法进入运行状态。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 47.3s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w: 47.3s (Evidence 42.5s, RCA 4.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-zz82w**: pod-volume-mount-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 70.287, "metrics": {"run_id": "0a5d5b298101433c", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 70.29629254341125, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-volume-mount-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-volume-mount-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 70296.29254341125, "llm_calls": 17, "llm_duration_ms": 63890.57970046997, "tool_calls": 19, "executed_tool_calls": 15, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 17, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 13266.763687133789, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 5745.922088623047}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15144.099473953247, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "durat